# Citation metadata for the release. The DOI is the Zenodo concept DOI (all versions); version 1.0.0 is 10.5281/zenodo.24612914.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and the accompanying paper once it is published."
title: "platelet-percolation: simulator and semi-empirical model of the geometric percolation threshold of finite-thickness platelets"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Iliut"
