doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24612913"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aiam-nano/platelet-percolation"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
abstract: "Monte Carlo simulator for the geometric percolation threshold of penetrable platelets of finite thickness, and a semi-empirical model of that threshold with five fitted constants (thickness, restacking, log-normal size dispersity, aligned domains and out-of-plane ripple), together with the calibration, the pre-registered tests, the sealed-exam records and the verification records behind the paper."
keywords:
